Modifications in this copy
--------------------------

Copied from https://github.com/jamro/tiny-engineer/tree/aefc852/3d_models
on 2026-11-04. Changed: added a "GH-S37D" servo preset to
`fusion/TinyEngineerTools/servos.json`. No other files were changed.
Also added `openscad/`, which builds `parts/gh-s37d/stl/` from the ES9051
STL export with the servo tab slots lengthened for the GH-S37D servo
(2026-11-04).
Added `openscad/HeadM5Dial.scad` (2026-11-05): a new fixed head that holds an
M5Stack Dial and mounts on the neck servo, replacing Head, Hat and Neck. Its
servo shaft socket copies the dimensions of the original Neck.
Removed `cad/` and `fusion/` (the Fusion 360 model and add-in) (2026-11-10):
the parts are built with OpenSCAD from the ES9051 STL export in
`openscad/base/es9051/`. The originals are at the Source Location above.
